{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/d76be4ba2ac8fb6a01679833ba7d68d7.avif?t=1756335001\" width=1560 height=255 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Animal kingdom is gearing up for nature's biggest soccer event!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Super Animal Soccer</strong>, 18 teams compete in an incredible world tournament, in stadiums around the globe, to rise to the top of the sports chain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/e579eeb68601d246b2b221caa3151a19.avif?t=1756335001\" width=1560 height=92 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/3569875536f6ed3abd419fcb83d79a03.poster.avif?t=1756335001\" width=422 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/3569875536f6ed3abd419fcb83d79a03.webm?t=1756335001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/3569875536f6ed3abd419fcb83d79a03.mp4?t=1756335001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass, shoot, dribble, and take down your opponents. The animals play fiercely, and with the <strong>Charged Shot</strong>, you can aim at an opponent to knock them out of the field. But be careful, a defensive <strong>Parry</strong> can throw you out of the stadium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/6affe7caa01c0846b2f94497fed63e3d.poster.avif?t=1756335001\" width=422 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/6affe7caa01c0846b2f94497fed63e3d.webm?t=1756335001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/6affe7caa01c0846b2f94497fed63e3d.mp4?t=1756335001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Customization and Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/a99d269f610f36d8cbd89ead9029f78b.avif?t=1756335001\" width=1560 height=255 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/43207ef597c0593ee3dfd167bd5b6a43.avif?t=1756335001\" width=1560 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend through the league's ranks by winning matches and earning rank points. The higher you get more challenging your opponents become. Ranking up also unlocks customization options and achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/7af5b7351f261f932765d6471e2a856e.poster.avif?t=1756335001\" width=190 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/extras/7af5b7351f261f932765d6471e2a856e.webm?t=1756335001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your players to enter the stadium in style. Throughout the championships, you will unlock various customization options.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Tour</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills by competing against teams from around the world and claim the title of World Champion.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tournament</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a classic championship with bracketed teams.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exhibition</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize a match against AI or against a friend in couch-coop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2939340?t=1756335001","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756335001","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/646b2868d6d4042433159e1c43ed2ca461d47658/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756335001","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/646b2868d6d4042433159e1c43ed2ca461d47658/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756335001","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/