 customization options.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Tour</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills by competing against teams from around the world and claim the title of World Champion.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tournament</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a classic championship with bracketed teams.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exhibition</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize a match against AI or against a friend in couch-coop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SheePixel Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939340/header.jpg?t=1756335001","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2939340/721115/3a02a85037bbe61202e3dbe008f6254c080a1029/1750890620/dash_av1.mpd?t=1721092310","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2939340/721115/3a02a85037bbe61202e3dbe008f6254c080a1029/1750890620/dash_h264.mpd?t=1721092310","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2939340/721115/3a02a85037bbe61202e3dbe008f6254c080a1029/1750890620/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1721092310","id":257035163,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257035163/movie.293x165.jpg?t=17210